# Data-driven integration test for hackathon/house_move, run by tests/integration/test_house_move_hocons.py.
# Format: https://github.com/cognizant-ai-lab/neuro-san/blob/main/docs/test_case_hocon_reference.md
#
# Discovery accuracy for C-10042 (Leeds to Harrogate). Ground truth, from the customer's synthetic transactions in
# coded_tools/hackathon/house_move/data/transactions.json:
# - providers: Brightwatt Energy, NVW Water Services, Fibrely Broadband, Voxmobile, TV Licensing, DVLA vehicle tax,
#   Shieldmotor Insurance (car), Hearthguard Home Insurance, Pawsure Pet Insurance, Little Acorns Nursery, PulseGym
#   and the Hopewell Trust (charity). Northway BS is their own mortgage, not something to notify.
# - life facts: a pet (pet insurance, vet, pet shop), a young child (nursery) and a car (vehicle tax, car insurance).
#
# Providers are checked by keyword where the LLM writes the name consistently, and by `gist` where it may change the
# capitalization (ShieldMotor, VoxMobile); inferred facts and anything worded freely are checked by `gist`.
# The test module issues a fresh session for C-10042 into HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_10042.
{
    "agent": "hackathon/house_move",
    "timeout_in_seconds": 300,
    "success_ratio": "1/1",
    "connections": ["direct"],
    "interactions": [
        {
            "text": "I'm moving house",
            "sly_data": {"session_token": ${HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_10042}},
            "response": {
                "text": {
                    "keywords": ["Brightwatt", "Fibrely", "TV Licen", "DVLA", "Little Acorns"],
                    "gist": [
                        """The reply names the providers Shieldmotor, Hearthguard and Pawsure among the organizations
found. Capitalization and the words after the brand (for example Insurance, Policy or Mobile) do not matter.""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a pet (for example because they pay for
pet insurance).""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a young child at nursery (for example
Little Acorns Nursery).""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a car or other vehicle (for example from
vehicle tax or car insurance).""",
                        """The reply names a water company (NVW Water Services or similar) and a mobile provider
(Voxmobile or similar) among the organizations found.""",
                        """The reply does not present everyday spending such as groceries, fuel, restaurants or parking
as organizations to tell about the move.""",
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
    ]
}
